ompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=06b653692f438696d47239e13f5901e2", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/834554df/uploads/origins/5ca1e9e8-dc7d-4d65-9894-5dadebd1f9a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=06b653692f438696d47239e13f5901e2, https://si.imgix.net/834554df/uploads/origins/5ca1e9e8-dc7d-4d65-9894-5dadebd1f9a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=52d4a14b350fc875436952360d734881 2x, https://si.imgix.net/834554df/uploads/origins/5ca1e9e8-dc7d-4d65-9894-5dadebd1f9a2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6a208a4a88e09e1adac4fe8e19b57d5a 3x"}, "body": "Sorry for the great delay, Mr. Yiri, but I would like to commission a new painting for \ud83d\ude47\u200d\u2640\ufe0f\ud83d\udca6.\n\nI had a lot of trouble deciding, but this time I would like you to draw a character of my creation. I don't care if it's a small or large child, either way. I like both of your designs so much that I couldn't choose one. Please choose the one you like best. We don't even have a pose for you to choose. You can draw it in any way you like.\n\nI have put some of the character settings and some of my drawings below for your reference.\nI look forward to seeing your work.\n\nSetting\nThe head (hair style) is jellyfish hair, and the angel's ringlets are water jellyfish.\nCute little girl\nClothes are silk, cuffs wide, one piece of cloth.\nHands are \ud83e\udd80.\nHer wings are a flying fish.\nShe has no facial expression. Does not show negative emotions.\n\nHere are the haircut material and the full body material. The hair style is different, but should match the hair material. Hair color is white and eye color is blue.\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-7VxPjiDMAoxBn5d0YgDqZa3Hf-yACd7", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@noyatabetai/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2283517, "client_id": 3316405, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3b0479c7/uploads/origins/e3eb5c43-7257-4e1a-ad51-d2c89801000b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a16dbe9cf0840ce046e3fdcccc4d377f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3b0479c7/uploads/origins/e3eb5c43-7257-4e1a-ad51-d2c89801000b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a16dbe9cf0840ce046e3fdcccc4d377f, https://si.imgix.net/3b0479c7/uploads/origins/e3eb5c43-7257-4e1a-ad51-d2c89801000b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8e256b41c15d0be3c7ba47698603f5f9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3b0479c7/uploads/origins/e3eb5c43-7257-4e1a-ad51-d2c89801000b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d9877ba807b0144e2baf09b24d2b6387 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3b0479c7/uploads/origins/e3eb5c43-7257-4e1a-ad51-d2c89801000b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=962393aaa193fa189e9ec7d0d1e31c89", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3b0479c7/uploads/origins/e3eb5c43-7257-4e1a-ad51-d2c89801000b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=962393aaa193fa189e9ec7d0d1e31c89, https://si.imgix.net/3b0479c7/uploads/origins/e3eb5c43-7257-4e1a-ad51-d2c89801000b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d33d6e54361b1fe2e229e6428df7b6cb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3b0479c7/uploads/origins/e3eb5c43-7257-4e1a-ad51-d2c89801000b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3a3c5ef0770943437245b4cd0eed5a8f 3x"}, "body": "I would like you to draw a picture for the header! I want a picture of a black cat staring at me. I'll leave the rest of the composition up to you! (I want the eyes to not cover the black part on top of the iphone screen...)", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@noyatabetai/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2283517, "client_id": 3387408, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bd177048/uploads/origins/a0ea72b6-8ee3-489b-88cc-4a4148d636ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10334e2b62097a771d57a0cf7b0fea89", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bd177048/uploads/origins/a0ea72b6-8ee3-489b-88cc-4a4148d636ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=10334e2b62097a771d57a0cf7b0fea89, https://si.imgix.net/bd177048/uploads/origins/a0ea72b6-8ee3-489b-88cc-4a4148d636ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed974654c74ab6dbf7abfd023aaae5ca 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bd177048/uploads/origins/a0ea72b6-8ee3-489b-88cc-4a4148d636ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c023fd049afd816d1992104869209e75 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bd177048/uploads/origins/a0ea72b6-8ee3-489b-88cc-4a4148d636ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fe68cfcf0bd7c942c1850e89c770dc54", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/bd177048/uploads/origins/a0ea72b6-8ee3-489b-88cc-4a4148d636ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=fe68cfcf0bd7c942c1850e89c770dc54, https://si.imgix.net/bd177048/uploads/origins/a0ea72b6-8ee3-489b-88cc-4a4148d636ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=795b1bfba97b9207bc1ad511a28f8f8a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/bd177048/uploads/origins/a0ea72b6-8ee3-489b-88cc-4a4148d636ac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2ea6f1cb8283c27e5b1309828eb69657 3x"}, "body": "Hi \u5148\u751f. I love your art style and would like for you to draw my original characters Akimitsu and Hatsuki in your style. Akimitsu is a handsome, tall, charming, delinquent. He is 182 cm. He is seen as a helpful and cool senpai, but in reality, is very cunning and mischievous. Hatsuki is a cheerful, cute, and naive teenager. He is 165 cm. Some important facial details are that Hatsuki has two moles on the left and right sides of his face and the bottom part of his right jaw. He is also wearing tiny black earrings. For the pose, can you please have Akimitsu messing with Hatsuki's hair with a teasing smile, while Hatsuki has a pout on his lips and looks mildly annoyed and is reaching his hands up to try and stop Akimitsu? Thank you for your time and consideration.\n\nAkimitsu: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lw9QknOgbgxUJKgiD-f5-qaSWLZXdbkc?usp=sharing\nHatsuki: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1zMAy6yO9srBXa-yClUOhWUmrAcH109Rn?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@noyatabetai/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2283517, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/02c7ee56/uploads/origins/d7f3a16f-8acc-46dc-9178-f39b87c0eb4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2b6cef6a7bbd49ad9bb3bb8ef6737421", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/02c7ee56/uploads/origins/d7f3a16f-8acc-46dc-9178-f39b87c0eb4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2b6cef6a7bbd49ad9bb3bb8ef6737421, https://si.imgix.net/02c7ee56/uploads/origins/d7f3a16f-8acc-46dc-9178-f39b87c0eb4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9ba2eaabeeba72e045088710172c04ef 2x, https://si.imgix.net/02c7ee56/uploads/origins/d7f3a16f-8acc-46dc-9178-f39b87c0eb4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=333ef44da6c2867c59d42b8862f33e85 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/02c7ee56/uploads/origins/d7f3a16f-8acc-46dc-9178-f39b87c0eb4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=14defdf8bdf33b955ad84004912d6603", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/02c7ee56/uploads/origins/d7f3a16f-8acc-46dc-9178-f39b87c0eb4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=14defdf8bdf33b955ad84004912d6603, https://si.imgix.net/02c7ee56/uploads/origins/d7f3a16f-8acc-46dc-9178-f39b87c0eb4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0d38299a10ef4671c46db388da656a15 2x, https://si.imgix.net/02c7ee56/uploads/origins/d7f3a16f-8acc-46dc-9178-f39b87c0eb4f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1a28403972b2de7a7ed85541cbdd66bd 3x"}, "body": "Thank you for your understanding.\nThis is my first time to send a request.\n\nI always enjoy seeing your wonderful illustrations on X. I love your illustrations so much that I contacted you to ask you to draw my original character!\nI love your illustrations so much that I contacted you to ask you to draw my original characters.\nWhat I would like to request are the two boys from the URL below.\n\nThey are brothers game players.\nYou can skip the details of the costumes.\n\nUsage\nVideo thumbnails and headers\nEnjoy looking at them\netc.\n(We do not use them for money-consuming purposes such as selling goods)\n\n*Size, etc.*\nI am happy to see a beautiful picture if the size is 1920px or larger!\nI will be happy to see a beautiful picture if the size is 1920px or more!\nI like any of your drawings, but I especially like high ones!\nI like any of your drawings, but I would appreciate it if you could draw it in a way that is easy for me to draw.\nI would be happy if you could draw it as a PSD file with separate layers for the background and the character.\n\nIf possible*, I would appreciate it if you could draw it as a PSD file with the background and the character in separate layers.\nI would appreciate it if you could trim the left, right and head of the characters without cutting them off.\nI would appreciate it if you could separate the layers so that I can use them one by one.\nI like coloring pictures, so I would appreciate it if you could give me line drawings of the characters.\n\n\nFor more details, please refer to the following URL.\n\n\u25bcCharacter\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1ErC1d9S9PWOgDm4j_ojzGq_ncezUlVGc?usp=drive_link\n\n\nThank you for your consideration.", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@noyatabetai/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2283517, "client_id": 2109664, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/80afe131/uploads/origins/21cd22a9-a6b2-4ac0-a007-be5e51da3af5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9f6f8ee2692c482f6f7e3c5c34abddd1", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/80afe131/uploads/origins/21cd22a9-a6b2-4ac0-a007-be5e51da3af5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9f6f8ee2692c482f6f7e3c5c34abddd1, https://si.imgix.net/80afe131/uploads/origins/21cd22a9-a6b2-4ac0-a007-be5e51da3af5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f4f451601747fc092cb8b35c550ba824 2x, https://si.imgix.net/80afe131/uploads/origins/21cd22a9-a6b2-4ac0-a007-be5e51da3af5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=64a2f8b89c2668e39856394874bcd0c1 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore":